{"id":"js-dom-eventos-y-escuchadores","title":"JS - DOM - Eventos y Escuchadores","topic":"javascript","topicLabel":"JavaScript","tags":["aprendizaje","javascript","dom"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"},{"depth":3,"text":"1. Registro moderno mediante addEventListener()","id":"1-registro-moderno-mediante-addeventlistener"},{"depth":3,"text":"2. Eventos comunes en el navegador","id":"2-eventos-comunes-en-el-navegador"},{"depth":3,"text":"3. Mini Proyecto Práctico: Cambiador de color interactivo","id":"3-mini-proyecto-practico-cambiador-de-color-interactivo"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":4,"words":274,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-13-27-05-26","title":"Sesion_13_27.05.26","topicLabel":"JavaScript","session":13}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Un <strong>evento</strong> es una señal o suceso que ocurre en el navegador al que JavaScript puede reaccionar (como hacer clic, escribir en un input, redimensionar la pantalla, o enviar un formulario). </p>\n<p>Los <strong>Escuchadores de eventos (Event Listeners)</strong> son el mecanismo moderno y recomendado para suscribir funciones a estos eventos en lugar de usar atributos inline en el HTML. Permite una separación completa entre estructura (HTML) y comportamiento (JS), permitiendo además asociar múltiples funciones a un único evento sobre el mismo elemento.</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><h3 id=\"1-registro-moderno-mediante-addeventlistener\" class=\"note__h\">1. Registro moderno mediante <code>addEventListener()</code></h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Sintaxis: elemento.addEventListener( nombre_evento, funcion_a_ejecutar );</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> boton = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;.btn-guardar&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">guardarProgreso</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;¡Progreso guardado con éxito!&quot;</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Vinculación limpia</span>\nboton.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, guardarProgreso);</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-eventos-comunes-en-el-navegador\" class=\"note__h\">2. Eventos comunes en el navegador</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inputTexto = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;#entradaNombre&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// click: Al hacer clic en un elemento</span>\nboton.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">alert</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;¡Clic! &quot;</span>));\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// input: Detecta cambios de texto en tiempo real en un input</span>\ninputTexto.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;input&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;El usuario está escribiendo: &quot;</span> + event.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>);\n});\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// submit: Captura el envío de un formulario</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> formulario = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;form&quot;</span>);\nformulario.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;submit&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  event.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preventDefault</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Evita el refresco de página por defecto</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Formulario capturado&quot;</span>);\n});</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-mini-proyecto-practico-cambiador-de-color-interactivo\" class=\"note__h\">3. Mini Proyecto Práctico: Cambiador de color interactivo</h3><p>Este script cambia el fondo de una tarjeta dinámicamente y muestra el texto ingresado en tiempo real:</p>\n<p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;contenedor&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cajaVisual&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputColor&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Escribe &#x27;red&#x27;, &#x27;blue&#x27;, &#x27;#1f4e79&#x27;...&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnAplicar&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Aplicar color<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;vistaPrevia&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Texto en espera...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> caja = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cajaVisual&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inputColor = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputColor&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> boton = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnAplicar&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> vistaPrevia = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;vistaPrevia&quot;</span>);\n\nboton.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> colorElegido = inputColor.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>();\n  caja.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">backgroundColor</span> = colorElegido;\n});\n\ninputColor.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;input&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">e</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  vistaPrevia.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Escribiendo color: &quot;</span> + e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>;\n});</code></pre></div>"}